.TH "AG\-CLI\-LABEL\-EDIT" "1" "2026\-10\-09" "AtomGit CLI 0.7.4" "AtomGit CLI Manual"
.SH NAME
\&ag\-cli\-label\-edit \- Edit a repository label
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
\&ag\-cli label edit [<owner>/<repo>] <name> [flags]
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
\&Edit a repository label. AtomGit API v5 accepts a new name and color for label updates.
.PP
\&When OWNER/REPO is omitted, the repository is inferred from the current Git repository. An explicit OWNER/REPO argument always takes precedence. Remote selection prefers remote.pushDefault, the current branch upstream, origin, then a unique AtomGit/GitCode remote.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-color <string>\fR
\&New label color in #RGB or #RRGGBB format
\&Default: \(dq\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-name <string>\fR
\&New label name
\&Default: \(dq\(dq.
.SH INHERITED OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h, \-\-help\fR
\&Show help for command
\&Default: \(dqfalse\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-raw\-output\fR
\&Disable terminal output sanitization for machine processing
\&Default: \(dqfalse\(dq.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
\&ag\-cli label edit owner/repo bug \-\-name defect \-\-color \(dq#d73a4a\(dq
.fi
